{"chapter": 0, "sha256": "989aea6ae012a1f37b78d715669a962c325613e1027574af084d6921d85e445c", "voice": {"voice_id": "ppLqTilh7rH7fbUVlXsf", "name": "David - Documentary", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2", "voice_settings": {"stability": 0.55, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.15, "use_speaker_boost": true}}, "source": "docs/script.md", "files": {"narration": {"file": "ch0.mp3", "text": "This is Giza at dawn, from the rooftops of Nazlet el-Samman. The Sphinx faces the sunrise, as it has for at least four and a half thousand years. Behind it stand the pyramids of Khufu and Khafre.\n\nThe textbooks say Khafre's workmen carved the Sphinx about 2500 BCE. Graham Hancock and Robert Bauval say the Sphinx and the plan of this plateau go back to about 10,500 BCE. Robert Schoch, a geologist, says the rock agrees with them.\n\nSo how old is the Sphinx? This piece makes their case as strongly as it can be made, and gives the archaeologists their answer. It starts where Schoch did, with the walls of the ditch.", "seconds": 47.55, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "i", "s", " ", "i", "s", " ", "G", "i", "z", "a", " ", "a", "t", " ", "d", "a", "w", "n", ",", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "o", "f", "t", "o", "p", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "N", "a", "z", "l", "e", "t", " ", "e", "l", "-", "S", "a", "m", "m", "a", "n", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "S", "p", "h", "i", "n", "x", " ", "f", "a", "c", "e", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "u", "n", "r", "i", "s", "e", ",", " ", "a", "s", " ", "i", "t", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", "t", " ", "l", "e", "a", "s", "t", " ", "f", "o", "u", "r", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "h", "a", "l", "f", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", ".", " ", "B", "e", "h", "i", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", " ", "s", "t", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "y", "r", "a", "m", "i", "d", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "K", "h", "u", "f", "u", " ", "a", "n", "d",